OL,5,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FJim receives news that Leila, his
OL,7,     Fwife, has been taken to the
OL,8,     Fhospital and his sons were killed
OL,9,     Fin an accident. Pat's trial comes
OL,10,     Fto an end.
OL,11,G0100 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FJudy does nothing to stop Pat, and
OL,13,     FSharon is sent to Solitary when
OL,14,     Fthe screws find the drugs in the
OL,15,     Fcell. Caroline refuses to let
OL,16,     FMichael pay their bail.
OL,17,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,18,     FLizzie and Doreen are charged with
OL,19,     Ftheft, Judy tries to get through
OL,20,     Fto Sharon, and Vera warns Caroline
OL,21,     Fthat she'll be keeping an eye on
OL,22,     Fher and Jim.
